-    d.  **Accept or Reject:** Generate a uniform random number $u \in [0, 1]$. If $u < a(\bar{x}_{i-1} \rightarrow \bar{y})$, accept the proposal: $\bar{x}_i = \bar{y}$. Otherwise, reject it: $\bar{x}_i = \bar{x}_{i-1}$ [S2].
